# Program Accreditation Folder Structure Reorganization — Task Plan & Implementation Log

## Plan
- High-level goal: Reorganize `resources/js/Pages/Documents/Program-Accreditation/Partials` into domain-specific subdirectories (Navigation, Modals, Hub, DocumentTypes) to prepare for feature expansion across all 5 Program Accreditation document types.
- Scope:
  - Create subdirectories: `Navigation/`, `Modals/`, `Hub/`, `DocumentTypes/SupportingDocs/`, `DocumentTypes/SelfSurvey/`, `DocumentTypes/ComplianceReports/`, `DocumentTypes/Ppp/`, `DocumentTypes/NarrativeProfile/`.
  - Move/split files into dedicated modules.
  - Split `ProfileDocumentsView.vue` into `PppView.vue` and `NarrativeProfileView.vue` so both document types have clean, dedicated workspaces.
  - Update `Index.vue` imports and template bindings.
  - Run frontend build (`npm run build`) and backend tests (`php artisan test`) to ensure zero regressions.
- Key decisions: Keep `Index.vue` as top-level coordinator so backend controllers, route URLs, and query parameters remain unchanged.
- Edge cases: Ensure event emits (`openUpload`, `backToHub`, `selectCategory`) and props continue to match exactly.
- Testing strategy: Run `npm run build` and `php artisan test --filter=ProgramAccreditationTest`.

## Implementation Progress
### [2026-09-27 / Session 1]
- [x] Subtask 1: Created new subfolders (`Navigation/`, `Modals/`, `Hub/`, `DocumentTypes/`).
- [x] Subtask 2: Separated `PppView.vue` and `NarrativeProfileView.vue` into dedicated workspaces under `DocumentTypes/`.
- [x] Subtask 3: Updated `Index.vue` imports and template bindings to match new structure.
- [x] Subtask 4: Cleaned up obsolete flat partials in `Partials/`.
- [x] Subtask 5: Verified frontend compilation (`npm run build`) and full backend test suite (`php artisan test` - 49/49 passed).

