## Lessons & Notes
- Splitting PPP and Narrative Profile early prevents bloated conditional views as soon as detailed quantitative tables and qualitative exhibits are implemented.
- Each document type now has its own home folder ready for sub-components (such as benchmark item cards, rating summary exports, and compliance matrices).
